{"seq":2,"slug":"fp-in-rust","title":"Rust 中的 FP","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-programming/fp-in-practice/fp-in-rust","wordCount":1056,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"rust-中的-fp\">Rust 中的 FP</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Rust 不是纯函数式语言，但它的每一处核心设计都透着函数式的影子：所有权系统天然保证不可变，<code>Option</code>/<code>Result</code> 取代 null 与异常，<code>match</code> 是真正的模式匹配，迭代器提供零成本的惰性管道。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Rust 特性</th>\n<th>FP 对应概念</th>\n<th>关键点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>所有权系统</td>\n<td>默认不可变、引用透明</td>\n<td>无需 GC 即内存安全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Option</code> / <code>Result</code></td>\n<td>Maybe / Either</td>\n<td><code>?</code> 运算符即 Monad bind</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Iterator</code> trait</td>\n<td>惰性管道 + 组合子</td>\n<td>零成本抽象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>enum</code> + <code>match</code></td>\n<td>ADT + 模式匹配</td>\n<td>编译器强制穷尽检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>trait</code> + 泛型</td>\n<td>类型类</td>\n<td>单态化实现零开销</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Rust 的取向是&quot;以系统级性能换取函数式表达力&quot;：它把 Haskell 的概念用单态化、所有权这些零成本机制重新实现，让 FP 抽象在运行时不留痕迹。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rust-的函数式基因\">Rust 的函数式基因</h2><p>Rust 虽然不是纯函数式语言，但它的设计深受函数式编程影响。<strong>所有权系统</strong>保证了安全的不可变性，<strong>Option/Result</strong> 替代了 null 和异常，<strong>模式匹配</strong>是一等特性，<strong>迭代器</strong>提供了惰性的函数式数据处理管道。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn process_numbers(numbers: &amp;[i32]) -&gt; Vec&lt;i32&gt; {&#10;    numbers&#10;        .iter()&#10;        .filter(|&amp;&amp;x| x &gt; 0)&#10;        .map(|&amp;x| x * 2)&#10;        .collect()&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn safe_divide(a: f64, b: f64) -&gt; Option&lt;f64&gt; {&#10;    if b == 0.0 { None } else { Some(a / b) }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn process_numbers(numbers: &#x26;[i32]) -> Vec&#x3C;i32> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    numbers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .iter()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .filter(|&#x26;&#x26;x| x > 0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .map(|&#x26;x| x * 2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .collect()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn safe_divide(a: f64, b: f64) -> Option&#x3C;f64> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if b == 0.0 { None } else { Some(a / b) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>FP 特性</th>\n<th>Rust 支持</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>不可变性</td>\n<td>✅ 默认</td>\n<td>变量默认不可变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Option/Result</td>\n<td>✅ 原生</td>\n<td>标准库枚举</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模式匹配</td>\n<td>✅ 原生</td>\n<td>match 表达式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>闭包</td>\n<td>✅ 原生</td>\n<td><code>|x| x + 1</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迭代器</td>\n<td>✅ 零成本抽象</td>\n<td>Iterator trait</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>泛型 + trait</td>\n<td>✅ 原生</td>\n<td>单态化编译</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代数数据类型</td>\n<td>✅ enum</td>\n<td>带关联数据的枚举</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高阶类型</td>\n<td>❌ 不支持</td>\n<td>GAT 部分替代</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    RUST[&quot;Rust&quot;] --&gt; OWNERSHIP[&quot;所有权系统&quot;]&#10;    RUST --&gt; ADT[&quot;代数数据类型&quot;]&#10;    RUST --&gt; ITER[&quot;迭代器&quot;]&#10;    RUST --&gt; PM[&quot;模式匹配&quot;]&#10;    OWNERSHIP --&gt; IMMUT[&quot;默认不可变&quot;]&#10;    OWNERSHIP --&gt; BORROW[&quot;借用检查&quot;]&#10;    ADT --&gt; OPTION[&quot;Option&amp;lt;T&amp;gt;&quot;]&#10;    ADT --&gt; RESULT[&quot;Result&amp;lt;T, E&amp;gt;&quot;]&#10;    ITER --&gt; LAZY[&quot;惰性求值&quot;]&#10;    ITER --&gt; ZERO[&quot;零成本抽象&quot;]\">graph TD\n    RUST[\"Rust\"] --&gt; OWNERSHIP[\"所有权系统\"]\n    RUST --&gt; ADT[\"代数数据类型\"]\n    RUST --&gt; ITER[\"迭代器\"]\n    RUST --&gt; PM[\"模式匹配\"]\n    OWNERSHIP --&gt; IMMUT[\"默认不可变\"]\n    OWNERSHIP --&gt; BORROW[\"借用检查\"]\n    ADT --&gt; OPTION[\"Option&amp;lt;T&amp;gt;\"]\n    ADT --&gt; RESULT[\"Result&amp;lt;T, E&amp;gt;\"]\n    ITER --&gt; LAZY[\"惰性求值\"]\n    ITER --&gt; ZERO[\"零成本抽象\"]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Rust 的所有权系统天然实现了函数式编程追求的不可变性——如果没有 <code>mut</code>，值就是不可变的。而借用检查器确保了在没有可变引用的情况下，数据不可能被意外修改。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"option-与-result\">Option 与 Result</h2><p>Rust 的 <code>Option&lt;T&gt;</code> 和 <code>Result&lt;T, E&gt;</code> 是语言级的函数式错误处理机制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn find_user(id: u32) -&gt; Option&lt;User&gt; {&#10;    USERS.get(&amp;id).cloned()&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn parse_config(path: &amp;str) -&gt; Result&lt;Config, ConfigError&gt; {&#10;    let content = std::fs::read_to_string(path)&#10;        .map_err(|e| ConfigError::IoError(e))?;&#10;    toml::from_str(&amp;content)&#10;        .map_err(|e| ConfigError::ParseError(e))&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn get_user_email(id: u32) -&gt; Option&lt;String&gt; {&#10;    find_user(id)&#10;        .filter(|u| u.is_active)&#10;        .map(|u| u.email.clone())&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn find_user(id: u32) -> Option&#x3C;User> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    USERS.get(&#x26;id).cloned()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn parse_config(path: &#x26;str) -> Result&#x3C;Config, ConfigError> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let content = std::fs::read_to_string(path)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .map_err(|e| ConfigError::IoError(e))?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    toml::from_str(&#x26;content)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .map_err(|e| ConfigError::ParseError(e))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn get_user_email(id: u32) -> Option&#x3C;String> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    find_user(id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .filter(|u| u.is_active)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .map(|u| u.email.clone())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Option 和 Result 的核心组合子：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组合子</th>\n<th>Option</th>\n<th>Result</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>map</td>\n<td><code>Option&lt;A&gt; → Option&lt;B&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>Result&lt;A,E&gt; → Result&lt;B,E&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>and_then</td>\n<td>flatMap</td>\n<td>flatMap</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>unwrap_or</td>\n<td>默认值</td>\n<td>默认值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ok_or</td>\n<td>Option → Result</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>?</code> 运算符</td>\n<td>提前返回 None</td>\n<td>提前返回 Err</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>filter</td>\n<td>条件过滤</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>map_err</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>变换错误类型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;find_user(id)&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;Some(user)&quot;| B[&quot;.filter(is_active)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;Some(user)&quot;| C[&quot;.map(get_email)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;Some(email)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt;|&quot;None&quot;| NONE1[&quot;None&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;None&quot;| NONE2[&quot;None&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"find_user(id)\"] --&gt;|\"Some(user)\"| B[\".filter(is_active)\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"Some(user)\"| C[\".map(get_email)\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"Some(email)\"]\n    A --&gt;|\"None\"| NONE1[\"None\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"None\"| NONE2[\"None\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"迭代器\">迭代器</h2><p>Rust 的 <strong>Iterator trait</strong> 是零成本抽象的函数式数据处理引擎。迭代器是惰性的——只有在消费时才真正计算：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"let sum_of_squares: i32 = (1..=10)&#10;    .filter(|x| x % 2 == 0)&#10;    .map(|x| x * x)&#10;    .sum();&#10;&#10;let words: Vec&lt;&amp;str&gt; = &quot;hello world foo bar&quot;&#10;    .split_whitespace()&#10;    .filter(|w| w.len() &gt; 3)&#10;    .collect();&#10;&#10;struct Fibonacci {&#10;    a: u64,&#10;    b: u64,&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl Iterator for Fibonacci {&#10;    type Item = u64;&#10;    fn next(&amp;mut self) -&gt; Option&lt;u64&gt; {&#10;        let result = self.a;&#10;        self.a = self.b;&#10;        self.b = result + self.b;&#10;        Some(result)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;let first_10_fib: Vec&lt;u64&gt; = Fibonacci { a: 0, b: 1 }&#10;    .take(10)&#10;    .collect();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let sum_of_squares: i32 = (1..=10)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .filter(|x| x % 2 == 0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .map(|x| x * x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .sum();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let words: Vec&#x3C;&#x26;str> = \"hello world foo bar\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .split_whitespace()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .filter(|w| w.len() > 3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .collect();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct Fibonacci {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    a: u64,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    b: u64,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl Iterator for Fibonacci {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    type Item = u64;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn next(&#x26;mut self) -> Option&#x3C;u64> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let result = self.a;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.a = self.b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.b = result + self.b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Some(result)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let first_10_fib: Vec&#x3C;u64> = Fibonacci { a: 0, b: 1 }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .take(10)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .collect();</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>迭代器适配器</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>惰性</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>map</td>\n<td>变换元素</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td><code>.map(|x| x * 2)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>filter</td>\n<td>条件过滤</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td><code>.filter(|x| x &gt; 0)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>flat_map</td>\n<td>展平映射</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td><code>.flat_map(|x| x.iter())</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>take</td>\n<td>取前 n 个</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td><code>.take(5)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>skip</td>\n<td>跳过前 n 个</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td><code>.skip(3)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>zip</td>\n<td>配对两个迭代器</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td><code>.zip(other)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>chain</td>\n<td>连接两个迭代器</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td><code>.chain(other)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>enumerate</td>\n<td>附加索引</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td><code>.enumerate()</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Rust 迭代器的&quot;零成本抽象&quot;意味着链式迭代器调用在编译后的性能与手写循环完全相同。LLVM 会将 <code>.filter().map().collect()</code> 优化为单次遍历循环。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"枚举与模式匹配\">枚举与模式匹配</h2><p>Rust 的 enum 是真正的代数数据类型，配合模式匹配构成了类型安全的控制流：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"enum Expr {&#10;    Lit(f64),&#10;    Add(Box&lt;Expr&gt;, Box&lt;Expr&gt;),&#10;    Mul(Box&lt;Expr&gt;, Box&lt;Expr&gt;),&#10;    Neg(Box&lt;Expr&gt;),&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn eval(expr: &amp;Expr) -&gt; f64 {&#10;    match expr {&#10;        Expr::Lit(n) =&gt; *n,&#10;        Expr::Add(a, b) =&gt; eval(a) + eval(b),&#10;        Expr::Mul(a, b) =&gt; eval(a) * eval(b),&#10;        Expr::Neg(e) =&gt; -eval(e),&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn simplify(expr: Expr) -&gt; Expr {&#10;    match expr {&#10;        Expr::Add(a, b) if matches!(*a, Expr::Lit(0.0)) =&gt; *b,&#10;        Expr::Add(a, b) if matches!(*b, Expr::Lit(0.0)) =&gt; *a,&#10;        Expr::Mul(a, _) if matches!(*a, Expr::Lit(0.0)) =&gt; Expr::Lit(0.0),&#10;        Expr::Neg(e) if matches!(*e, Expr::Neg(_)) =&gt; {&#10;            if let Expr::Neg(inner) = *e { *inner } else { unreachable!() }&#10;        }&#10;        other =&gt; other,&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>enum Expr {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Lit(f64),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Add(Box&#x3C;Expr>, Box&#x3C;Expr>),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Mul(Box&#x3C;Expr>, Box&#x3C;Expr>),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Neg(Box&#x3C;Expr>),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn eval(expr: &#x26;Expr) -> f64 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match expr {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Expr::Lit(n) => *n,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Expr::Add(a, b) => eval(a) + eval(b),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Expr::Mul(a, b) => eval(a) * eval(b),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Expr::Neg(e) => -eval(e),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn simplify(expr: Expr) -> Expr {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match expr {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Expr::Add(a, b) if matches!(*a, Expr::Lit(0.0)) => *b,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Expr::Add(a, b) if matches!(*b, Expr::Lit(0.0)) => *a,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Expr::Mul(a, _) if matches!(*a, Expr::Lit(0.0)) => Expr::Lit(0.0),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Expr::Neg(e) if matches!(*e, Expr::Neg(_)) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if let Expr::Neg(inner) = *e { *inner } else { unreachable!() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        other => other,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    EXPR[&quot;Expr&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;Lit&quot;| LIT[&quot;f64 字面量&quot;]&#10;    EXPR --&gt;|&quot;Add&quot;| ADD[&quot;左 + 右&quot;]&#10;    EXPR --&gt;|&quot;Mul&quot;| MUL[&quot;左 × 右&quot;]&#10;    EXPR --&gt;|&quot;Neg&quot;| NEG[&quot;取反&quot;]&#10;    ADD --&gt; EVAL[&quot;递归求值&quot;]&#10;    MUL --&gt; EVAL&#10;    NEG --&gt; EVAL\">graph TD\n    EXPR[\"Expr\"] --&gt;|\"Lit\"| LIT[\"f64 字面量\"]\n    EXPR --&gt;|\"Add\"| ADD[\"左 + 右\"]\n    EXPR --&gt;|\"Mul\"| MUL[\"左 × 右\"]\n    EXPR --&gt;|\"Neg\"| NEG[\"取反\"]\n    ADD --&gt; EVAL[\"递归求值\"]\n    MUL --&gt; EVAL\n    NEG --&gt; EVAL</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Rust ADT 特性</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>FP 对应概念</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>enum 变体</td>\n<td>带关联数据的和类型</td>\n<td>Sum Type</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>struct</td>\n<td>积类型</td>\n<td>Product Type</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>match 穷尽</td>\n<td>编译器强制处理所有变体</td>\n<td>Exhaustiveness</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>if let</td>\n<td>单变体匹配</td>\n<td>部分模式匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>?</code> 运算符</td>\n<td>Result/Option 的提前返回</td>\n<td>Monad bind</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"trait-与泛型\">Trait 与泛型</h2><p>Rust 的 trait 系统在功能上接近 Haskell 的类型类（Type Class）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"trait Mappable {&#10;    type Item;&#10;    type Output&lt;B&gt;;&#10;    fn map_over&lt;B, F: Fn(Self::Item) -&gt; B&gt;(self, f: F) -&gt; Self::Output&lt;B&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl&lt;A&gt; Mappable for Option&lt;A&gt; {&#10;    type Item = A;&#10;    type Output&lt;B&gt; = Option&lt;B&gt;;&#10;    fn map_over&lt;B, F: Fn(A) -&gt; B&gt;(self, f: F) -&gt; Option&lt;B&gt; {&#10;        self.map(f)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl&lt;A&gt; Mappable for Vec&lt;A&gt; {&#10;    type Item = A;&#10;    type Output&lt;B&gt; = Vec&lt;B&gt;;&#10;    fn map_over&lt;B, F: Fn(A) -&gt; B&gt;(self, f: F) -&gt; Vec&lt;B&gt; {&#10;        self.into_iter().map(f).collect()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>trait Mappable {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    type Item;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    type Output&#x3C;B>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn map_over&#x3C;B, F: Fn(Self::Item) -> B>(self, f: F) -> Self::Output&#x3C;B>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl&#x3C;A> Mappable for Option&#x3C;A> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    type Item = A;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    type Output&#x3C;B> = Option&#x3C;B>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn map_over&#x3C;B, F: Fn(A) -> B>(self, f: F) -> Option&#x3C;B> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.map(f)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl&#x3C;A> Mappable for Vec&#x3C;A> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    type Item = A;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    type Output&#x3C;B> = Vec&#x3C;B>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn map_over&#x3C;B, F: Fn(A) -> B>(self, f: F) -> Vec&#x3C;B> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.into_iter().map(f).collect()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比</th>\n<th>Rust trait</th>\n<th>Haskell 类型类</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>多态方式</td>\n<td>单态化（编译时）</td>\n<td>字典传递（运行时）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>孤儿规则</td>\n<td>✅ 有</td>\n<td>❌ 无（可重叠）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关联类型</td>\n<td>✅ 有</td>\n<td>✅ Type Family</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高阶类型</td>\n<td>⚠️ GAT 部分</td>\n<td>✅ 完整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>默认实现</td>\n<td>✅ 有</td>\n<td>✅ 有</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Rust 的 trait 单态化意味着泛型函数在编译后会为每个具体类型生成一份专用代码——这是&quot;零成本抽象&quot;的关键。你使用 trait 定义的 Functor-like 抽象，在运行时不会有任何额外开销。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((Rust 中的 FP))&#10;    所有权系统&#10;      默认不可变&#10;      借用检查&#10;      安全无 GC&#10;    Option / Result&#10;      替代 null / 异常&#10;      ? 运算符&#10;      组合子丰富&#10;    迭代器&#10;      惰性求值&#10;      零成本抽象&#10;      函数式管道&#10;    ADT + 匹配&#10;      enum 和类型&#10;      match 穷尽检查&#10;      表达式求值&#10;    Trait 系统&#10;      类似类型类&#10;      单态化&#10;      GAT\">mindmap\n  root((Rust 中的 FP))\n    所有权系统\n      默认不可变\n      借用检查\n      安全无 GC\n    Option / Result\n      替代 null / 异常\n      ? 运算符\n      组合子丰富\n    迭代器\n      惰性求值\n      零成本抽象\n      函数式管道\n    ADT + 匹配\n      enum 和类型\n      match 穷尽检查\n      表达式求值\n    Trait 系统\n      类似类型类\n      单态化\n      GAT</pre><ul>\n<li>Rust 的<strong>所有权系统</strong>天然保证不可变性和内存安全，无需垃圾回收。</li>\n<li><strong>Option/Result</strong> + <code>?</code> 运算符提供了类型安全的空值和错误处理，完全替代 null 和异常。</li>\n<li><strong>Iterator trait</strong> 提供惰性、零成本的函数式数据处理管道。</li>\n<li><strong>enum + match</strong> 是真正的代数数据类型 + 模式匹配，编译器强制穷尽检查。</li>\n<li><strong>trait 系统</strong>在功能上接近 Haskell 类型类，通过单态化实现零成本抽象。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Rust 中的 FP","id":"rust-中的-fp"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Rust 的函数式基因","id":"rust-的函数式基因"},{"level":2,"text":"Option 与 Result","id":"option-与-result"},{"level":2,"text":"迭代器","id":"迭代器"},{"level":2,"text":"枚举与模式匹配","id":"枚举与模式匹配"},{"level":2,"text":"Trait 与泛型","id":"trait-与泛型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"TypeScript 中的 FP","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-programming/fp-in-practice/fp-in-typescript"},"next":{"title":"状态管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-programming/fp-in-practice/state-management"}}